Just a short comment for when you are back to working on this PR. We should use a cheaper hash function and one that will behave better over space. The current one (while slightly improved by removing the sin) breaks down pretty quickly over time.

I suggest "Hash without Sin" By Dave Hoskins on Shadertoy: https://www.shadertoy.com/view/4djSRW
```
vec3 hash33(vec3 p3) {
    p3 = fract(p3 * vec3(.1031, .1030, .0973));
    p3 += dot(p3, p3.yxz+33.33);
    return fract((p3.xxy + p3.yxx)*p3.zyx);
}
```
